Z||000008||fropuff||06-18-2001||11:00 AM||||Thanks a lot for the help everyone!  I got them out pretty easily, and already got them painted up.  Look ten times better.  I'm going to do the mirrors and drip rails today.  All the little stuff until I save up to paint the ground effects, front fascia, and wing.  Then all I have to paint on the exterior is the moldings.  Thanks again!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
